/* AM Network — free, offline FAQ assistant.
 *
 * Replaced the paid /chat AI assistant (October 2026). Every answer below is
 * written ahead of time, so the widget costs nothing per question, works with
 * the backend asleep, and never improvises facts or religious rulings.
 *
 * Matching: the visitor's text is normalised and scored against each entry's
 * keywords (all languages pooled, so a question typed in any language finds
 * its answer); the best entry wins. No match → an honest fallback with links.
 *
 * Keep the facts in sync with docs/messaging-2026-11.md (the single source of
 * truth for how AM Network describes itself: no money held, in-person checks,
 * open report, pilot timing, no token, no certification claimed).
 *
 * Hybrid mode (October 2026): tapping a ready-made question chip is still
 * answered here, free. A question the visitor TYPES goes to the live AI
 * assistant (/chat on the backend) when LIVE_AI is true; if that call fails
 * for any reason — backend asleep, daily budget used up, LIVE_AI_ENABLED off
 * on Render (410) — the visitor silently gets the offline answer instead.
 * Only the assistant spends AI credits; nothing else on the site does.
 */
